                                "sense_id": "f6be5ab8-73db-38af-b3dc-2ccf01d70c7f",
                                "text": "As they above the rest were Lords of Earth and Ayre.\nThe Gossander with them, my goodly Fennes doe show\nHis head as Ebon blacke, the rest as white as Snow,"
                            }
                        ]
